WEBVTT

00:08:29.463 --> 00:08:31.235
there's a 17 percent chance

00:08:31.235 --> 00:08:33.040
he's in the NBA right now.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:35.978
(Laughter)

00:08:35.978 --> 00:08:38.854
That is, find six honest seven footers,

00:08:38.854 --> 00:08:42.084
one is in the NBA right now.

00:08:42.084 --> 00:08:44.913
And that's not the only way that
NBA players' bodies are unique.

00:08:44.913 --> 00:08:47.528
This is Leonardo da Vinci's "Vitruvian Man,"

00:08:47.528 --> 00:08:48.951
the ideal proportions,

00:08:48.951 --> 00:08:50.950
with arm span equal to height.

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:53.458
My arm span is exactly equal to my height.

00:08:53.458 --> 00:08:55.594
Yours is probably very nearly so.

00:08:55.594 --> 00:08:57.756
But not the average NBA player.

00:08:57.756 --> 00:09:00.563
The average NBA player is a shade under 6'7",